OL,3,GNEWSAQueen's University students blast
OL,4,Aoff to US for Nasa robotics competition
OL,5,
OL,6,FCould a robot designed by young
OL,7,Fengineering students from Northern
OL,8,FIreland end up on the Moon?
OL,10,FA team, from Queen's University Belfast
OL,11,F(QUB), are heading to Florida later
OL,12,Fthis month to take part in a Nasa
OL,13,F'lunabotics' competition.
OL,15,FLunabotics is a university-level
OL,16,Fcompetition for teams to use the Nasa
OL,17,Fsystems engineering process to design,
OL,18,Fbuild, and operate a lunar robot.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
