OL,3,GNEWSAQueen's University students blast
OL,4,Aoff to US for Nasa robotics competition
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe students created a lab-built robot
OL,7,Fthat they will bring to the competition
OL,8,Fto find out how it would deal with
OL,9,Ffuture moon missions.
